 searches on user-reported phishing and malware attacks#Related#{5}":[301,301],"#Sightings searches on user-reported phishing and malware attacks#Related#{6}":[302,302],"#Sightings searches on user-reported phishing and malware attacks#Related#{7}":[303,303],"#Sightings searches on user-reported phishing and malware attacks#Related#{8}":[304,304],"#Sightings searches on user-reported phishing and malware attacks#Related#{9}":[305,306]},"outlinks":[{"title":"observables","target":"c_Observables","line":24},{"title":"sightings","target":"indicator-sightings","line":24},{"title":"malware","target":"threat-intelligence-malware","line":26},{"title":"Perform an email sightings search","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/sighting-searches-on-phishing-attacks.md","line":33},{"title":"Perform an observable sightings search","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/sighting-searches-on-phishing-attacks.md","line":33},{"title":"Security Incident Response","target":"sir-landing-page","line":33},{"title":"tools","target":"tools","line":33},{"title":"Create sightings search configuration records","target":"sightings-search-configurations","line":53},{"title":"Overview tab","target":"vr-va-ws-overview-tab","line":82},{"title":"Explore","target":"threat-intelligence-security-center-overview","line":84},{"title":"saved searches","target":"https://docs.splunk.com/Splexicon:Savedsearch","line":239},{"title":"Security Operations","target":"security-operations-landing-page","line":272},{"title":"Create sightings search configuration records","target":"sightings-search-configurations","line":297},{"title":"Sightings","target":"indicator-sightings","line":298},{"title":"Observables","target":"c_Observables","line":299},{"title":"Malware","target":"threat-intelligence-malware","line":300},{"title":"Tools","target":"tools","line":301},{"title":"Security Incident Response","target":"sir-landing-page","line":302},{"title":"Overview tab","target":"vr-va-ws-overview-tab","line":303},{"title":"Explore","target":"threat-intelligence-security-center-overview","line":304},{"title":"Security Operations","target":"security-operations-landing-page","line":305}],"metadata":{"title":"Sightings searches on user-reported phishing and malware attacks","description":"Perform sightings searches on emails or observables to determine how often certain types of attacks, such as phishing attacks or communications with a malicious IP or URL occur in your network. Each occurrence is considered a sighting. Sightings searches for observables must be configured for your log stores or security information and event management \\(SIEM\\).Search for users who have received phishing emails based on observables such as email subject, sender name, or message ID. You can then contain and eradicate these phishing emails from your organization.Perform sightings searches on observables to find out how many users have visited a malicious or suspicious website within a specific period.Create multiple sightings search configuration records and use them while querying multiple log stores or varying the search parameters.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/security-incident-response/sighting-searches-on-phishing-attacks.html","release":"australia","product":"Security Incident Response","classification":"security-incident-response","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":10,"breadcrumb":["Manage security threats using the Security Analyst Workspace","Security Incident Response","Enterprise security case management applications","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#sir","#security-incidents","#investigation","#soar","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:S